{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1e5da0fd-61f0-8a17-9883-d82011d34fa1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T15:18:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:16:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. [pause] Yeah, I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house. It's on Callender Avenue, 101, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 101 Callender. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:16:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's grunting. That's the only word I have for it. Slow, gurgling, and then the water just sits and backs up into the street. Any time we get a thaw, like this week with the snowbanks melting. And it's not even raining, it's dry out today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:16:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's the melt running down and the drain can't keep up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. [sighs] And it's not new. My neighbor, the one next door, says it happens every big rain. Every one. So this has been going on a good while and nobody's done anything that I can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's worth getting looked at. Is the water getting onto your property, or just pooling in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the road and the edge of the driveway. It hasn't come in the house, thank God. But I'm renting, and I shouldn't have to wade out to my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check and clear that drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you tell me when they last came by? Because I've never seen anybody. Not once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the record for that street. [pause] I'm not seeing a cleaning logged for that drain in my screen here, but the older notes may be on paper. I'll ask the crew supervisor to check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Well, that tells me something. I've lived on Aquidneck Island my whole life, it's the only place I've ever lived, and that drain has been bad as long as I can remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like it's overdue, then. Do you want a call back when it's been looked at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0195, Nancy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nancy Thurston, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Nancy, it's in. Someone should be out early next week, and we'll call you either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll believe it when I see the truck. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T15:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
